==Battleground==
*5 [[Croco]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*8 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Master A.]] spawns as the boss after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 6.67~8 seconds<sup>200f~240f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Despite the presence of a Metal Hippoe in this stage, a [[:Category:Critter-class Cats|Critter]] is not necessary here. If a workable critter (such as [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Jurassic Cat Sitter]] or [[Space Cat (Rare Cat)|Major Space Cat]]) is owned, however, be sure to bring them. Otherwise, beat down Metal Hippoe as you normally would: spam fast-attacking cats to whittle down its health through brute force. Once Metal Hippoe is disposed of, you are free to take out Master A. using tanky units like [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]].

